<title>CHILE: Provida reports slightly higher 9-month net.</title>
<headline>Provida reports slightly higher 9-month net.</headline>
<dateline>SANTIAGO 1996-10-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pension fund administrator Provida SA reported the following nine-month earnings.</p>
<p>				To Q3 1996	  To Q3 1995</p>
<p> Total revenues		 42.7		    43.6</p>
<p> Operating income	     11.0		    11.9</p>
<p> Non-operating income	 -1.4 (loss)	   -2.2 (loss)</p>
<p> Net earnings		    8.50		    8.49</p>
<p>NOTE: All figures in billions of pesos.</p>
<p>--Roger Atwood, Santiago newsroom *56-2-699-5595 x211</p>
</text>
